message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below. · 如果在工作中用到了本项目，请按下面的信息引用。"
type: software
title: "Storewright, StoreX and StoreX Chain: digital twins of grocery store operations and of a store's supply chain"
abstract: >-
  A portfolio project in three parts, built only from public information and synthetic data, and not affiliated with any
  retailer or company. Storewright (part 1) is a digital twin of a grocery store: the 3D store follows live operations,
  replays the day and forecasts the next hours, and drives fulfilment, backroom work and AI on associate phones.
  StoreX (part 2) redesigns the store for 2030 and compares it item by item with the previous generation on the same
  discrete-event simulation engine, with a browser simulator and planning, comparison and business reports.
  StoreX Chain (part 3) places the store in its full supply chain (sea, rail, air and long-haul road freight, a
  distribution center and the fleet) with a 3D regional twin, a dispatch board, a closed-loop twin, a twin server for
  external engines, and planning, comparison and business reports.
authors:
